      <h1>Apps Court Car Boot Sale, Walton-on-Thames</h1>
      <p>A practical, independently verified guide to Apps Court Car Boot Sale at Apps Court Farm on Hurst Road: opening times, seller pitch prices, buyer parking, facilities and rules, checked against official sources.</p>
