  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-layout">
      <article class="prose">
        <p>Apps Court Car Boot Sale is one of Surrey's largest and longest-running outdoor car boot sales, held at Apps Court Farm on Hurst Road, Walton-on-Thames. It regularly attracts hundreds of sellers and thousands of buyers looking for second-hand goods, bric-a-brac and bargains, and is one of the most searched-for car boot sales near Hampton Court, Molesey and Sunbury as well as Walton itself.</p>

        <EventStatusPanel
          status={STATUS}
          headline={STATUS_HEADLINE}
          detail={STATUS_DETAIL}
          checkedDate={STATUS_CHECKED_DATE}
          sourceLabel={STATUS_SOURCE_LABEL}
          sourceUrl={STATUS_SOURCE_URL}
        />

        <p class="disclaimer-note">Walton-on-Thames.org is an independent local guide and is not affiliated with, or operated by, Apps Court Farm. Every fact on this page is dated and sourced (see "Sources and last checked" near the bottom), but Apps Court Farm's own site is always the definitive word on whether a specific date is running.</p>

        <h2 id="key-info">Apps Court Car Boot Sale at a glance</h2>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="info-table">
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">Venue</th><td>Apps Court Farm</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Address</th><td>Hurst Road, Walton-on-Thames, Surrey, KT12 2EG</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Usual day</th><td>Sundays, weather and ground conditions permitting</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Usual season</th><td>Early March to the autumn, plus selected Spring, Summer and early Winter Bank Holiday Mondays</td></tr>
